  "posts": [
    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "With Cubs reaching an agreement with Japanese slugger Teruaki Sato, sources confirm to Tribune, it answers big question on how to mitigate loss of offensive production from Suzuki/Happ in OF. A big 24 hours by Jed Hoyer & Cubs to address clear roster needs & continued payoff to investment in Japan.",
      "likes": 55,
      "reposts": 7,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-24T15:30:44.037Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3n32xmgskgc2o",
      "jp_players": [
        "Suzuki"
      ],
      "jp": "カブスが日本のスラッガー、佐藤輝明と合意とTribuneに情報筋。鈴木誠也/Happの外野での攻撃力流出をどう補うかという大きな疑問への答えに。ホイヤーとカブスは外野の補強ポイントに対応した大きな24時間で、日本への投資も実を結び続ける。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "This is also a major factor in the #BlueJays becoming a premiere destination for Japanese stars, which I expect to continue. What Taira or Okamoto face coming to MLB really isn't comparable to MLB free agents moving cities. Toronto has handled this very well. Word gets around.",
      "likes": 58,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-25T02:53:50.084Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n345rw5hwc2q",
      "jp_players": [
        "Okamoto"
      ],
      "jp": "これも#BlueJaysが日本人スターにとって最高の移籍先になりつつある大きな要因で、今後も続くと見ている。平良や岡本がMLBに来て直面することは、MLBのFA選手が球団を移るのとは比べものにならない。トロントは見事に対応してきた。評判は広がる。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "This offseason, I've had two former #BlueJays tell me that, if everything were equal, Toronto is the only place they'd want to play. Money always wins, but that reputation is fully out there now. My working theory is that this is most valuable to veterans (with families), but...",
      "likes": 81,
      "reposts": 11,
      "replies": 7,
      "at": "2026-11-25T02:47:53.318Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n345hbvtms2p",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "This is also a major factor in the #BlueJays becoming a premiere destination for Japanese stars, which I expect to continue.\n\nWhat Taira or Okamoto face coming to MLB really isn't comparable to MLB free agents moving cities. Toronto has handled this very well. Word gets around.",
          "likes": 58,
          "author": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "All things equal I would also like to play for the blue jays",
          "likes": 8,
          "author": "8fullhourssleep.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "My guess is Gaus and Biebs. I’d still imagine one or both are still on their list",
          "likes": 4,
          "author": "huedub.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Are these recent former Blue Jays, or classic former Blue Jays?\n\nIt'd be interesting to see how that reputation has changed over the decades.",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "theterroirist.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "このオフ、元#BlueJaysの選手2人から「条件が同じなら、プレーしたいのはトロントだけ」と聞いた。結局は金がものを言うが、その評判はもう完全に定着している。特に家族のいるベテランにとって価値が大きいというのが私の仮説だが…"
    },
    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "Cubs have agreed to a multi-year deal with LHP Trevor Rogers, sources confirm to the Tribune. Rogers, who turned 29 earlier this week, had rejected a qualifying offer from the Orioles.",
      "likes": 42,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-24T04:15:32.467Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2zrv3xkds2u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "カブスが左腕トレバー・ロジャース投手と複数年契約で合意したと、Tribuneに情報筋。今週29歳になったロジャースは、オリオールズからのクオリファイングオファーを拒否していた。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "bastianmlb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jordan Bastian",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The Cubs are in agreement, pending physical, with Japanese slugger Teruaki Sato on a 6-year, $120 million deal, sources tell me and @feinsand.bsky.social. This after landing LHP Trevor Rogers (5-yr, $120M) Monday night. @michael-cerami.bsky.social was first on the Sato agreement.",
      "likes": 32,
      "reposts": 5,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-24T15:21:14.780Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:rcetk47n6hybe57ou4m36jf6/app.bsky.feed.post/3n32x3hwaec2h",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "カブスが日本のスラッガー、佐藤輝明と6年1億2000万ドルで合意（メディカルチェック待ち）と、私と@feinsand.bsky.social に情報筋。月曜夜には左腕トレバー・ロジャース（5年1億2000万ドル）も獲得済み。佐藤との合意は@michael-cerami.bsky.social が最初に報じた。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "The Guardians and lefty starter Kris Bubic have reached a one-year deal worth $17.5 million, according to MLB.com's Mark Feinsand.",
      "likes": 34,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-24T15:58:03.006Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3n32z5btv4c22",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ガーディアンズと先発左腕クリス・ブービックが、1年1750万ドルで合意したとMLB.comのマーク・ファインサンド記者。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
      "author": "Andy Kostka",
      "team": "オリオールズ",
      "outlet": "Baltimore Banner",
      "text": "Left-hander Trevor Rogers is in agreement on a deal with the Cubs, source confirms, as @jonmorosi reported first. Rogers was a big part of the Orioles’ rotation in 2025 and 2026. He posted a 1.81 ERA in ‘25 and followed it with a 4.03 in ‘26 (2.90 ERA over his last 20 games)",
      "likes": 24,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-11-24T04:02:13.111Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:licyksm72ljqiq4oxbwxu2mi/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2zr5bn6a225",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "左腕トレバー・ロジャースがカブスと合意と情報筋が確認。@jonmorosi が最初に報じた。ロジャースは2025年と2026年のオリオールズ先発陣の主力で、25年は防御率1.81、26年は4.03（直近20試合は2.90）。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "For William Contreras, Jackson Chourio and Antonio Senzatela, there was a second championship parade this week. www.mlb.com/world-baseba...",
      "likes": 23,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-24T20:26:25.783Z",
